DC13:              ; The formula evaluator starts with
DC13:              ; [TXTPTR] pointing to the first character of the formula.
DC13:              ; At the END [TXTPTR] points to the terminator.
DC13:              ; The result is LEFT in the FAC.
DC13:              ; On RETURN [a] does not reflect the terminator.
DC13:              
DC13:              ; The formula evaluator uses the operator LIST (OPTAB)
DC13:              ; To determine precedence and dispatch addresses FOR
DC13:              ; Each operator.
DC13:              ; A temporary result on the stack has the following format.
DC13:              ;	The address of the operator routine.
DC13:              ;	The floating point temporary result.

