E479:              
E479:              ; "FRETMP" is passed a string descriptor pntr in [y,a]*
E479:              ; A check is made to see IF the string descriptor points to the last
E479:              ; Temporary descriptor allocated by PUTNEW.
E479:              ; IF so, the temporary is freed up by the updating of [TEMPPT]*
E479:              ; IF a temp is freed up, a further check sees IF the string DATA that
E479:              ; That string temp pnt'd to is the lowest part of string space in use.
E479:              ; IF so, [FRETOP] is updated to reflect the fact the fact that the space
E479:              ; Is no longer in use.
E479:              ; The addr of the actual string is returned in [y,x] and
E479:              ; Its length in acca.
E479:              
E479:              FRESTR:
E479: 20 04 dc             JSR     CHKSTR               ;Make sure its a string.
