          NATURAL LOG FUNCTION.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
E794:                      .subttl NATURAL LOG FUNCTION.
E794:              
E794:              ; Calculation is by:
E794:              ; Ln(f*2^n)=(n+LOG2(f))*ln(2)
E794:              ; An approximation polynomial is used to calculate LOG2(f)*
