EDDD:                      .subttl POLYNOMIAL EVALUATOR AND THE RANDOM NUMBER GENERATOR.
EDDD:                                                   ;Evaluate p(x^2)*x
EDDD:                                                   ;Pointer to DEGREE is in [y,a]*
EDDD:                                                   ;The constants follow the DEGREE.
EDDD:                                                   ;FOR x=FAC, compute:
EDDD:                                                   ; C0*x+c1*x^3+c2*x^5+c3*x^7+...+c(n)*x^(2*n+1)
EDDD:              POLYX:
EDDD:                      STWD    POLYPT               ;Retain polynomial pointer FOR later.
EDDD: 85 b1                STA     POLYPT
EDDF: 84 b2                STY     POLYPT + 1
EDE1: 20 a2 e9             JSR     MOV1F                ;SAVE FAC in factmp.
EDE4: a9 97                LDA     #TEMPF1
EDE6: 20 00 e8             JSR     FMULT                ;Compute x^2.
EDE9: 20 f7 ed             JSR     POLY1                ;Compute p(x^2)*
EDEC:                      LDWDI   TEMPF1
