          POLYNOMIAL EVALUATOR AND THE RANDOM NUMBER GENERATOR.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EE27:              
EE27:                                                   ;Psuedo-random number generator.
EE27:                                                   ;IF arg=0, the last random number generated is returned.
EE27:                                                   ;IF arg .lt. 0, a new sequence of random numbers is
EE27:                                                   ;Started using the argument.
EE27:                                                   ;   To form the NEXT random number in the sequence
EE27:                                                   ;Multiply the previous random number by a random constant
EE27:                                                   ;And add in another random constant. the then ho
EE27:                                                   ;And lo bytes are switched, the exponent is put where
EE27:                                                   ;It will be shifted in by NORMAL, and the exponent in the FAC
EE27:                                                   ;Is set to 200 so the result will be less than 1. this
EE27:                                                   ;Is then normalized and saved FOR the NEXT TIME.
EE27:                                                   ;The ho and low bytes were switched so there will be a
EE27:                                                   ;Random chance of getting a number less than or greater
EE27:                                                   ;Than .5 *
EE27:              
EE27:              RMULZC:
EE27: 98                   .byte   0o230
EE28: 35                   .byte   0o065
EE29: 44                   .byte   0o104
EE2A: 7a                   .byte   0o172
EE2B:              RADDZC:
EE2B: 68                   .byte   0o150
EE2C: 28                   .byte   0o050
EE2D: b1                   .byte   0o261
EE2E: 46                   .byte   0o106
EE2F:              
EE2F:              RND:
EE2F: 20 03 ea             JSR     SIGN                 ;GET SIGN into accx.
EE32:                      .IF     REALIO != 3
EE32: aa                   TAX
EE33:                      .endif
EE33:                                                   ;GET into accx, since "MOVFM" uses accx.
EE33: 30 4d   EE4D         BMI     RND1                 ;START new sequence IF negative.
EE35:                      .IF     REALIO == 3
EE35:                      BNE     QSETNR
EE35:                                                   ;Timers are at 9044(l0),45(hi),48(lo),49(hi) hex.
EE35:                                                   ;First two are always free running.
EE35:                                                   ;Second pair is not. lo is freer than hi then.
EE35:                                                   ;So order in FAC is 44,48,45,49.
EE35:                      LDA     CQHTIM
EE35:                      STA     FACHO
EE35:                      LDA     CQHTIM + 4
EE35:                      STA     FACMOH
EE35:                      LDA     CQHTIM + 1
EE35:                      STA     FACMO
EE35:                      LDA     CQHTIM + 5
EE35:                      STA     FACLO
EE35:                      JMP     STRNEX
EE35:                      .endif
EE35:              QSETNR:
EE35:                      LDWDI   RNDX                 ;GET last one into FAC.
EE35: a9 cb                LDA     #RNDX & 0o377
EE37: a0 00                LDY     #RNDX / 0o400
EE39: 20 7a e9             JSR     MOVFM
EE3C:                      .IF     REALIO != 3
EE3C: 8a                   TXA                          ;FAC was ZERO?
EE3D: f0 26   EE26         BEQ     RANDRT
EE3F:                      .endif
EE3F:                                                   ;Restore last one.

